{"id":"cee8253e7f3f324a","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-inductive-fixed-point.md","title":"Inductive Fixed Point Theorem","display":"thm-inductive-fixed-point — Inductive Fixed Point Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-inductive-fixed-point","aliases":["72-thm-inductive-fixed-point"],"display":"thm-inductive-fixed-point — Inductive Fixed Point Theorem","depends_on":["[[72-df-inductive-definition]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV §3.2.1; print269; PDF281; displayed local Knaster–Tarski argument","verification_status":"source-and-argument-reviewed","proof_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_2026_10_22":"补出算子的逐点包含诱导最小不动点包含"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-inductive-fixed-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-inductive-fixed-point</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-inductive-fixed-point — Inductive Fixed Point Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bf103f8baf1db1b8\" href=\"?note=bf103f8baf1db1b8\" title=\"72-df-inductive-definition\">72-df-inductive-definition</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV §3.2.1; print269; PDF281; displayed local Knaster–Tarski argument"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-and-argument-reviewed"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_2026_10_22","html":"补出算子的逐点包含诱导最小不动点包含"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi:\\mathcal P(A)\\to\\mathcal P(A)\">\\(\\Phi:\\mathcal P(A)\\to\\mathcal P(A)\\)</span> 为单调函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=\\operatorname{Ind}(\\Phi)\">\\(I=\\operatorname{Ind}(\\Phi)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bf103f8baf1db1b8\" href=\"?note=bf103f8baf1db1b8\" title=\"72-df-inductive-definition\">72-df-inductive-definition</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Phi(I)=I\\land\\forall X\\subseteq A\\ (\\Phi(X)\\subseteq X\\to I\\subseteq X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Phi(I)=I\\land\\forall X\\subseteq A\\ (\\Phi(X)\\subseteq X\\to I\\subseteq X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M_A:=\\{\\Psi\\in\\mathcal P(A)^{\\mathcal P(A)}:\\forall X,Y\\subseteq A\\ (X\\subseteq Y\\Rightarrow\\Psi(X)\\subseteq\\Psi(Y))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M_A:=\\{\\Psi\\in\\mathcal P(A)^{\\mathcal P(A)}:\\forall X,Y\\subseteq A\\ (X\\subseteq Y\\Rightarrow\\Psi(X)\\subseteq\\Psi(Y))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\Psi\\in\\mathcal M_A\\quad\n(\\forall X\\subseteq A\\ \\Phi(X)\\subseteq\\Psi(X))\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{Ind}(\\Phi)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ind}(\\Psi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\Psi\\in\\mathcal M_A\\quad\n(\\forall X\\subseteq A\\ \\Phi(X)\\subseteq\\Psi(X))\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{Ind}(\\Phi)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ind}(\\Psi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>上游给出最小前不动点与不动点的完整集合论证明。固定点是前不动点的特例，所以这同时推出旧条的最小固定点结论；没有把单调性隐藏在一个未量化的 Monotone 名称中。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span> 逐点包含于单调算子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Psi\">\\(\\Psi\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J=\\operatorname{Ind}(\\Psi)\">\\(J=\\operatorname{Ind}(\\Psi)\\)</span>；固定点等式给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi(J)\\subseteq\\Psi(J)=J\">\\(\\Phi(J)\\subseteq\\Psi(J)=J\\)</span>，因此J是Φ的前不动点，Φ的最小性给所示包含。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M_A\">\\(\\mathcal M_A\\)</span> 是幂函数集的分离子集，所有新增量化保持在集合层。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-inductive-definition","status":"resolved","id":"bf103f8baf1db1b8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-inductive-definition]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-inductive-definition","status":"resolved","id":"bf103f8baf1db1b8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A$ 为集合，$\\Phi:\\mathcal P(A)\\to\\mathcal P(A)$ 为单调函数；$I=\\operatorname{Ind}(\\Phi)$ 见 [[72-df-inductive-definition]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi:\\mathcal P(A)\\to\\mathcal P(A)","display":false},{"tex":"I=\\operatorname{Ind}(\\Phi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi(I)=I\\land\\forall X\\subseteq A\\ (\\Phi(X)\\subseteq X\\to I\\subseteq X).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal M_A:=\\{\\Psi\\in\\mathcal P(A)^{\\mathcal P(A)}:\\forall X,Y\\subseteq A\\ (X\\subseteq Y\\Rightarrow\\Psi(X)\\subseteq\\Psi(Y))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\Psi\\in\\mathcal M_A\\quad\n(\\forall X\\subseteq A\\ \\Phi(X)\\subseteq\\Psi(X))\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{Ind}(\\Phi)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ind}(\\Psi).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Psi","display":false},{"tex":"J=\\operatorname{Ind}(\\Psi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi(J)\\subseteq\\Psi(J)=J","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M_A","display":false}],"bytes":1792,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-286","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-inductive-fixed-point|thm-inductive-fixed-point — Inductive Fixed Point Theorem]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-284","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[thm-inductive-fixed-point — Inductive Fixed Point Theorem](72-thm-inductive-fixed-point.md)"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-302","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-thm-inductive-fixed-point|thm-inductive-fixed-point — Inductive Fixed Point Theorem]]"},{"id":"ce118b25d2b12cdc","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-488","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-thm-inductive-fixed-point]]"}],"outgoing":["bf103f8baf1db1b8"]}